    <string name="ui_add_up_to_20_images_with_android_s">Android i bithe sonjore agūra be baitalafi 20 nirugan de isitala nonggici ombi. Fejergi tray de provider buhe oci šoyobuha nirugan, bithe i gebu, crop i amba ajige jai bithe dasabuha erin iletulembi. Bithe i gebu eici dasabuha erin de acabume ilibuci ombi; ilibureci aifini sindaha nirugan i ba halarakū.\n\nŠoyobuha nirugan be darafi sonjombi. Crop image tere nirugan be fafulambi; Batch crop sonjoho nirugan de pixel eici percent i dulimbai ba be emu mudan de baitalambi. Crop handle be tatara eici ton be dosimbu. Reset crop daci dalba de bederembi. Crop oci daci bithe be halarakū, bederebuci ombi.\n\nŠoyobuha nirugan be jafafi tatara, eici baita ba de sindaha nirugan be tatara, iletulehe dalba de sinda. Hacihiyaha doigomšoro nirugan adali obure ba be yargiyan i tuwabumbi. Ici ergi de holbobuci dergi dalba be acabumbi; fejergi de holbobuci hashū dalba be acabumbi. Šoyobuha nirugan be darafi + target be daraci inu ombi. Ujui nirugan oci origin de deribumbi. Ejen nirugan be crop seci, tuttu holboho nirugan inu gurimbi. Nirugan be acabume dabališaci ojorakū.\n\nSame width jai Same height oci nirugan emgeri beye i aspect ratio be tuwakiyame, eiten dosimbuha nirugan de emu adali amba ajige bure. Pixels, percent, Smallest eici Largest be sonjo. Restore original sizes oci damu adali obuha amba ajige be bederebumbi, crop be bibumbi.\n\nUnplace oci damu sonjoho nirugan be tray de bederembi. Amargi nirugan akū ba be duibulembi, tuttu sindaha songko be bibumbi. Remove oci tere dosimbuha nirugan be teile meitembi. Undo/Redo de ere kūbulin be bederebuci ombi. Sindaha nirugan be tatara de ilibun be halambi; untuhun ba be tatara de tuwabun gurimbi. Juwe anggala be baitalafi zoom. Show all changes oci yooni nirugan acabun be tuwabure adali zoom sembi, output i amba ajige be halarakū.\n\nSave PNG oci acabuhangge nirugan be PNG seme bibumbi. Edit in Paint oci main editor de unggifi bederebuci ojoro nirugan halan seme arambi. Output memori budget be tucibuci, ajige output copy be sonjo. Daci bithe halarakū. Te i assembly be kikay de bibufi, si dahame dosirede neimbi.\n\nEre mode de main editor i Help dorgi Catrobat/AGPL jai asset credit adali baitalambi.</string>
